#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_folder.rst:5
msgid "Create category"
msgstr "创建类别"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_folder.rst:7
msgid "Working with collections can only be done from `collections panel`_."
msgstr "集合的相关操作只能在 `集合面板 <collections panel_>`_ 中进行。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_folder.rst:11
msgid ""
"Select **Settings > Display > Collections** menu item to display the "
"`collections panel`_."
msgstr "选择 **设置 > 显示 > 集合** 菜单项以显示 `集合面板 <collections panel_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_folder.rst:13
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows creating categories at some collection. The user has "
"only read rights at `QET collection`_, the user can create categories at "
"`User collection`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 允许在某个集合中创建类别。用户对 `QET 集合 <QET collection_>`_ 只有读取权限，可以在 `用户集合 "
"<User collection_>`_ 中创建类别。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_folder.rst:16
msgid ""
"Right click on `User collection`_ or at a category / sub-category from the "
"`User collection`_."
msgstr ""
"右键单击 `用户集合 <User collection_>`_，或右键单击 `用户集合 <User collection_>`_ 中的某个类别/子类别。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_folder.rst:21
msgid "Figure: Options at folder"
msgstr "图：文件夹上的选项"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_folder.rst:23
msgid ""
"Click the option **New folder** to open **Add a new category** PopUp window."
msgstr "单击 **新建文件夹** 选项，打开 **添加新类别** 弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_folder.rst:28
msgid "Figure: New category PopUp window"
msgstr "图：新建类别弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_folder.rst:30
msgid "Define the internal name for the file system."
msgstr "定义用于文件系统的内部名称。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_folder.rst:31
msgid ""
"Define the category name that will be displayed at the collection tree, it "
"can be defined in many languages."
msgstr "定义将显示在集合树中的类别名称，该名称可以用多种语言定义。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_folder.rst:32
msgid "Press **OK** to add the new category / sub-category."
msgstr "单击 **OK** 添加新类别/子类别。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/create_folder.rst:36
msgid ""
"QElectroTech works according `ISO 639-1`_ norm. The folder name language is "
"defined using 2 letter code which should be used at the language column from"
" the folder internal name table."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 遵循 `ISO 639-1`_ 规范。文件夹名称的语言使用两位字母代码定义，该代码应填写在文件夹内部名称表的语言列中。"
